WEBVTT

00:07:57.737 --> 00:08:00.702
where there's just a little less going on,

00:08:00.726 --> 00:08:02.815
you know, it's more mellow,
it's more chill,

00:08:02.839 --> 00:08:05.155
and that's where you feel
that you're most alive.

00:08:05.179 --> 00:08:08.494
CA: So someone could be shy
but be an extrovert,

00:08:08.518 --> 00:08:11.634
in the sense that they actually
want to connect with other people,

00:08:11.658 --> 00:08:15.207
they just don't know how to,
and they're fearful of that moment

00:08:15.231 --> 00:08:17.586
of initiating connection, perhaps.

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:21.219
So, there's a child sort of reluctant

00:08:21.243 --> 00:08:24.087
to go out and introduce
themselves to someone,

00:08:24.111 --> 00:08:25.933
because they don't know what to say.

00:08:25.957 --> 00:08:29.164
But when they do, then they're happy
to spend lots and lots of time

00:08:29.188 --> 00:08:30.358
with those people.